WEBVTT

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:03.160
A community reward should be easy to share.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:07.660
With MonliPay, one funded link can pay one person or an entire group.

00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:11.090
Here is the working product on Monad testnet.

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:14.840
Let's create a group payment for 10 people.

00:00:15.270 --> 00:00:16.550
Choose a token.

00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:20.520
Set the total pool to 100 and select 10 recipients.

00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:23.620
Equal amount gives each wallet 10 tokens.

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:26.960
Anyone can claim or you can limit access to selected wallets.

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:33.370
Confirm the token approval and fund the pool.

00:00:33.390 --> 00:00:35.670
The money is now held by the contract.

00:00:35.690 --> 00:00:39.140
Copy the link and share it in your group's existing chat.

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:42.750
There is no need to collect 10 wallet addresses first.

00:00:44.490 --> 00:00:48.650
The recipient opens the same link and sees their exact share.

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:51.890
Connect a wallet, then choose Claim my payment.

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:54.760
Ten tokens arrive in one transaction.

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:58.480
Each wallet can claim once until the slots are filled.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:01.530
Public claims need a wallet and network gas.

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:04.280
Back in My Links,

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:09.050
the sender can see how many payments have been claimed and what remains in the pool.

00:01:09.070 --> 00:01:11.970
Unclaimed funds can be refunded after the deadline.

00:01:13.830 --> 00:01:16.520
For a giveaway, switch to Random amount.

00:01:16.540 --> 00:01:19.430
For a single recipient, use a Payment Link.

00:01:19.450 --> 00:01:24.790
Both use the same token picker, and saved contacts make repeat payments easier.

00:01:26.220 --> 00:01:28.940
Private Payment is also available on mainnet.

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:35.140
A passkey protects saved payment records and AnomaPay shields transfers inside its pool.

00:01:35.160 --> 00:01:37.740
Deposits and withdrawals remain public.

00:01:39.720 --> 00:01:45.090
Create a link, share it in a chat, let recipients claim when they are ready.

00:01:45.110 --> 00:01:47.160
Try MonliPay at monlipay.xyz.
